# Files in this package that stow must NOT symlink into $HOME.
# LaunchDaemons are system-wide (/Library/LaunchDaemons), never per-user, so
# there is no ~/Library/LaunchDaemons for stow to target correctly. `stow
# macos` would otherwise create a dead symlink there. Install manually — see
# macos/README.md.
^/Library/LaunchDaemons$
# Package docs, not a dotfile. Needed because a package-level .stow-local-ignore
# makes stow skip the global ignore file (which would otherwise cover this).
^/README\.md$
